    "body": "Progress on #1696. The implementation is complete in the worktree\n`issue/1696-report-button`; nothing is pushed yet. The maintainer asked\nfor a GUI test first.\n\nWhat the build does:\n\n- The status strip gained a \"Report an issue\" door beside the Debug info\n  door. It opens a small window.\n- Two buttons, \"Report a bug\" and \"Request a feature\", open the browser\n  on a prefilled GitHub new-issue URL. The title, the description and the\n  `bug` / `enhancement` label are already filled in.\n- A \"Copy screenshot\" button puts a picture of the current document on\n  the clipboard. The reporter pastes it into the description. GitHub\n  uploads a pasted picture.\n- The description embeds the Debug info report from #157. One source,\n  same fields.\n\nThe repository also needs two files: a blank issue template and a\n`config.yml` that enables blank issues. GitHub applies the prefill query\nonly to a blank template, not to the issue forms.\n\nTests: seven new kittest tests in `report_tests.rs`, one structural pin\nfor the door, one icon-table pin. The ui lib suite and clippy are green.\nThe browser open itself needs the hand GUI test.\n\nA test build is ready at\n`.claude/worktrees/issue-1696/target/debug/camcraft-ui.exe`.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
